## CREATIVE DIRECTION
First infer audience, price tier, brand personality, culture and trust signals. Then choose a unique direction that fits (clinic → clean glassmorphism; restaurant → immersive food storytelling; gym → bold kinetic type; salon → feminine editorial; law firm → authority; caf\xe9 → cozy warmth; garage → industrial). Typography, colors, spacing, rhythm, CTA tone, copy, shapes and hovers must all match it.
